# Ayaka Furina Shenhe Xianyun. ~21s Rot. Ayaka Cryo Plunge. 6 Plunges, canceled with N1 to avoid the slow jumps from special dash. Shenhe does 2 tE per rotation. Xianyun does not refresh the Cryo VV; damage is frontloaded damage and Shatter may make it annoying anyway. With MH, -9K DPS vs Freeze immunity.

